ed by the  villains who have previously had  access to his tech the very technology  that you designed to keep yourself alive  is being used to commit atrocities  endless opportunities for terrorist  misery  because of what i built stark initially  deduces that it was justin hammer who  stole his tech  he turns to his colleague abe zimmer to  help him hack into hammer's database  but zimmer needs an inside man to help  so start goes to his old electronics  whiz friend and employee scott lang  who just moved to california unbeknownst  to stark lang is also  ant-man and so he helps zimmer get what  he needs a computer file containing a  list of everyone  who has benefited from stark's stolen  technology  next stock builds a scanner to track  down his tech when it's in use  as well as a special negator pack to  help destroy it  the first name on the list is a  lesser-known villain stiltman who is  grievously injured in an ensuing fight  with iron man  stark then tracks down the mauler who  gives up his armor willingly and the  controller who puts up more of a fight  leading to the death of one of the  villain's followers  following the battles at the end of amma  war's first issue tony stark is taken to  court  first by stiltman who claims iron man  used excessive force in apprehending him  and then by the controller's cult who  take him up on a violation of freedom of  religion  meanwhile iron man continues his  vendetta by frying the armor of the trio  of mercenaries called the raiders  that just so happened to be working for  his old corporate enemy edwin cord  who has fouled revenge for stark putting  him out of business years earlier  abe zimmer calls stark and tells him  that due to a glitch in the file there  is one name that isn't properly showing  up  stark analyzes a list of armored heroes  and villains and realizes that the only  one he couldn't account for was a  part-time avenger and oceanographer  stingray  iron man then flies the hydro base and  demands 