n  man then uses firepower's molten rock  against him  disorienting taggett for long enough to  apply a negator pack to his armor  but nothing happens firepower reveals  that the government has analyzed the  equipment and found a way to shield  against iron man's attempted sabotage  iron man is then forced to make his  escape in a helicopter piloted by jim  rhodes  but when it becomes clear that roadie's  life is at risk iron man leaps back out  again  and is immediately destroyed by one of  firepower's nuclear missiles  of course it soon turns out that stark  faked the death of iron man  putting a little blood inside his armor  and remotely piloting it to its doom  bruised and beaten stark is more than  happy to let iron man stay dead and  move on with his life when boynton comes  to claim the firepower armor that he  financed however  cord refuses to give it up as he now has  his own agenda  destroying tony stark first he uses  firepower to intimidate the people doing  business with him  then firepower begins destroying company  property finally he delivers a message  to the man himself  quit stark enterprises or die stark  responds by building a brand new iron  man suit  specifically designed to defeat  firepower which he vows to destroy  as soon as the threat is dealt with  predictably firepower shows up at a new  branch opening for stark enterprises  and in the battle that follows it  becomes clear that iron man has a  counter for every one of firepower's  tricks when firepower finally attempts  to launch one of his nuclear missiles  he discovers to his horror that it has  jammed iron man uses an electromagnetic  pulse to shut down firepower's systems  and then uses his computer to find the  cancellation code for the nuke  defeated and humiliated firepower points  out that more like him will come  which finally convinces stark to keep  iron man alive  the armor wars arc ends with stark going  home victorious  and finally getting some well-deserved  rest all rig